110
00:05:17,670 --> 00:05:22,810
A controlled Kacher that switches on at the half-wave and pushes current.

111
00:05:23,430 --> 00:05:24,570
Anyway, that's the deal.

112
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:25,990
